@LookFutureApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health Check
GET {{LookFutureApi_HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/html

### Analyze Idea (E2E Test Scenario)
POST {{LookFutureApi_HostAddress}}/api/ideas/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raw_description": "AI-powered inventory forecasting SaaS for local bakeries",
  "category": "B2B SaaS",
  "region": "North America"
}

### Get History
GET {{LookFutureApi_HostAddress}}/api/ideas/history?limit=20
Accept: application/json

